    "measurementTechnique": [
      "We implemented use of the DOE's Energy Exascale Earth System Model (E3SM) to conduct point scale simulations of the listed ameriflux sites. We used the global soil wetness project (GSWP3) atmospheric forcing dataset. We ran the model in default mode, with dynamic fine root distribution module, and with dynamic fine root to leaf allocation module, and a final simulation with these modules combined. We used the advanced decomposition scheme to spin up the model runs and analyzed data from the transient run (1950-2015).",
      "We combined each transient simulation into one file for easier download and data management."
    ],
